cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ClavisCage in your work, please cite the software and the method papers for the
  algorithms you used (listed under references).
type: software
title: ClavisCage
abstract: >-
  A Rust engine for clathrate-hydrate cage analysis (TRACE, HTR, GRADE, CHILL+, F3/F4, averaged
  Steinhardt q4/q6, MCG-3, tetrahedral order and guest occupancy) with one periodic-geometry layer
  and a method registry, compiled to WebAssembly for the browser application and to a Python wheel
  for Blender.
